  <li>Manuscripts must be original and not previously published or under review elsewhere.</li>
  <li>Submissions should adhere to the formatting and style guidelines provided by the conference or journal.</li>
  <li>All submissions will undergo a rigorous peer-review process by experts in the field.</li>
  <li>Papers should be submitted electronically through the conference or journal submission system.</li>
</ul>

